Decisions not in the brief: `Bearer` match is case-sensitive (spec writes `'Bearer '` literally); bearer regex allows any whitespace between `Bearer` and token and handles multiple occurrences per string; sensitive-key match wins over bearer handling (whole value becomes `'[redacted]'`); only plain objects (`Object.prototype`/`null` proto) are traversed, class instances/Dates pass through by reference so “nothing else changes”.

